  "body": "Positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac just off Takapuna’s Golden Mile, this substantial lakefront residence enjoys an exceptional location within easy walking distance of both Takapuna and Milford, with nearby access to Thorne Bay and Milford Beach, across the road via Audrey Lane. Originally constructed in the 1960s and extensively renovated in 2008, the home combines original brick construction with a Sto plaster exterior, Gibbston Valley schist detailing, double-glazed joinery and a long-run roof.\r\n\r\nSecure gates open to a private, north-facing courtyard a great way to bring in the all-day sun. The generous kitchen and informal living area connect beautifully to the courtyard, creating a sheltered setting for relaxed entertaining. The farmhouse-inspired kitchen features excellent cabinetry, a Falcon freestanding cooker, Liebherr refrigeration and Blum fittings.\r\n\r\nThe main living and dining area is superb, with a high-stud timber feature ceiling, gas fireplace and bifold doors opening to an elevated deck. From here, exceptionally wide views stretch across Lake Pupuke, creating a remarkable backdrop throughout the day and lake summer sunsets.\r\n\r\nAlso on the upper level, the spacious master suite enjoys lake views, extensive fitted wardrobes and a large ensuite with separate bath and shower. Sliding doors allow the suite to be opened to the view or closed for complete privacy. A guest powder room, spacious home office, double internal-access garage, laundry and loft storage complete this floor.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a second substantial living area flows directly to the lakeside patio, lawn and water’s edge. Complete with a gas fireplace, heat pump and kitchenette/bar area, this is an outstanding space for entertaining or extended family living. Three double bedrooms, two bathrooms and a second laundry are also located on this level.\r\n\r\nOffering genuine flexibility for families, guests or multi-generational living—with wheelchair access available to the upper floor.\r\n\r\nIF YOU CAN'T REACH ANDREW DORREEN, PLEASE CONTACT HIS SALES ASSOCIATE ANNA JONES ON 021 489 171",
